TITLE Equilibration 100C pH5 Ba 0.1 mol/kgw with mineral assemblage
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH   5 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ba   100
    -water 1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Talc           0 10
    Rhodochrosite  0 10
    Sepiolite      0 10
    Sepiolite(d)   0 10
    Pb(OH)2        0 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
    -totals Ba Mg Si Mn Pb C
    -si Talc Rhodochrosite Sepiolite Sepiolite(d) Pb(OH)2 Witherite Barite

END
